# Guitar stand, empty (issue 107): what the guitar's tile shows while the guitar is off it (being played). Drawn from Marc's folding wooden floor stand seen from above, small (about 8 px wide): two flat bars in a V with black rubber dots, joined at a padded block. Same place as the stand in `guitar`, so the guitar seems to be lifted from it. No brand, no text.
size: 16x16
